   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiation Plan-Ecosystem Restoration and Resilient Development in CHTComponent 1: Women &amp; Girls Empowerment through Inclusive Education in CHT (WGEIE)Component 2: Community Resilience through Locally-led Inclusive Adaptation (CoRLIA)The geographical coverage of the ERRD-CHT project will cover all 26 Upazilas of 3 District of CHT. The implementing partners will be Hill District Councils of Bandarban, Rangamati and Khagrachari.</narrative>
